  "description": "\"You have a knack for driving people crazy.\"\n\nA marriage that began without love.\nThe distance that always existed between him and me.\n\n\"Hang in there. You've done well so far. Nothing will change.\"\n\nThe only person I wanted to lean on in this house was becoming a source of despair.\n\n\"...Let's get a divorce.\"\n\n\"I've liked Jeong-hu for a long time. Even before we got married.\"\n\nHe remained silent despite my belated confession. We\nwere living in the same space, but in different times.\n\nThe time difference between us had already grown. Could we bridge that gap?\n\n\n**Original Novel**:   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://m.series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=5569069), [Kakaopage](https://page.kakao.com/content/56507229)   \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3302000560?_rdt_sid=author&_rdt_idx=5)\n\n**Original Webtoon**:   \n[R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/3093003705?_rdt_sid=author&_rdt_idx=7), [R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/3093003696?_s=instant&_q=%EA%B2%B0%ED%98%BC%EC%8B%9C%EC%B0%A8&_rdt_sid=search_instant&_rdt_idx=4&_rdt_arg=%EA%B2%B0%ED%98%BC%EC%8B%9C%EC%B0%A8)",
